WEBVTT

00:00:07.514 --> 00:00:10.414
The funds and the personnel are all in place.

00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:13.854
Please, just take it easy till it's time, Major.

00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:18.414
Right. I think I'll check in on the
queen's development now and then.

00:00:18.654 --> 00:00:19.524
Besides...

00:00:19.824 --> 00:00:23.264
they have a toy there that
I'm sure I'll enjoy teasing.

00:00:26.304 --> 00:00:29.204
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:00:29.604 --> 00:00:32.474
Boy, does it feel great

00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:35.604
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:39.204
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:00:41.114 --> 00:00:42.284
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:42.284 --> 00:00:43.414
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:00:43.414 --> 00:00:44.714
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:00:44.714 --> 00:00:46.384
Zettai Karen Children

00:00:46.384 --> 00:00:47.414
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:00:47.584 --> 00:00:50.854
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:00:50.854 --> 00:00:53.324
The limiter on my heart

00:00:54.064 --> 00:00:56.754
Has been released, and then you see

00:00:57.164 --> 00:01:00.364
Yes! Change the world!

00:01:00.604 --> 00:01:03.464
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:07.074
Reaching through what's real

00:01:07.074 --> 00:01:10.314
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:01:10.314 --> 00:01:13.244
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:01:14.384 --> 00:01:20.854
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:01:20.854 --> 00:01:26.794
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:01:27.194 --> 00:01:31.634
If you can take pride in a smile

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:33.604
That suits no one else

00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:38.374
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:01:38.374 --> 00:01:42.464
We can try over the future world!

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:43.074
Yeah!

00:01:43.814 --> 00:01:44.474
Ultimate!

00:01:46.614 --> 00:01:47.844
Daring!

00:02:05.634 --> 00:02:08.234
It's so silly and childish.

00:02:08.234 --> 00:02:10.534
Do kids really get into this stuff?

00:02:23.784 --> 00:02:25.084
Wow, that was scary.

00:02:25.084 --> 00:02:27.854
Oh, brother. Okay, time to go home.

00:02:28.684 --> 00:02:30.414
Was it that scary?!

00:02:30.824 --> 00:02:31.794
Look, as a psychometrist, I help
with criminal investigations.

00:02:31.794 --> 00:02:34.424
9th sense.
"Gorgeous Bods! We're Grown-Ups Now!?"
Look, as a psychometrist, I help
with criminal investigations.

00:02:34.424 --> 00:02:35.224
Look, as a psychometrist, I help
with criminal investigations.

00:02:35.464 --> 00:02:39.164
So I'm not scared of real weird killers at all.

00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:41.864
But monsters and ghosts are different...

00:02:41.864 --> 00:02:44.104
Which is why I said we shouldn't
go to a horror movie!

00:02:44.104 --> 00:02:46.134
Huh? But it was fun!

00:02:46.744 --> 00:02:49.614
Wow. Still, I'm kind of relieved.

00:02:49.614 --> 00:02:51.674
"They usually talk like they're grown-ups,

00:02:51.674 --> 00:02:54.344
"but inside the three of
them are still just kids."

00:02:55.414 --> 00:02:56.814
...is what he's thinking.

00:02:56.814 --> 00:02:58.084
Darn it, Shiho!

00:02:58.084 --> 00:03:00.174
Don't call us kids!

00:03:00.424 --> 00:03:02.284
Even though he didn't, really.

00:03:02.284 --> 00:03:04.224
Kaoru, you...

00:03:04.224 --> 00:03:06.024
"...are a kid because you do stuff like this."

00:03:06.464 --> 00:03:08.864
I SAID, DON'T CALL US KIDS!

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:11.034
Still didn't say it.

00:03:11.034 --> 00:03:12.904
For crying out loud, you three...

00:03:12.904 --> 00:03:15.034
We're 10 years old!

00:03:15.034 --> 00:03:16.834
Treat us like grown-ups!

00:03:16.834 --> 00:03:19.494
Buy it! Buy it! Buy it!

00:03:19.704 --> 00:03:21.234
I said no and I mean it!

00:03:21.374 --> 00:03:23.844
No! No! You cheapskate!

00:03:23.844 --> 00:03:27.044
How is she grown-up? She's totally a little kid.

00:03:27.484 --> 00:03:29.354
It's not just any toy!

00:03:29.354 --> 00:03:31.014
It's a super-rare limited edition!

00:03:31.014 --> 00:03:34.184
Otherwise I'll have to pay double
for it on an auction site!

00:03:34.454 --> 00:03:36.784
If you want it that bad, just buy
it with your allowance.

00:03:36.924 --> 00:03:39.984
Espers spend their money as fast as they get it!

00:03:41.094 --> 00:03:41.994
Let's go.

00:03:41.994 --> 00:03:42.984
Right.

00:03:44.134 --> 00:03:45.864
It was a limited edition, too...

00:03:45.864 --> 00:03:47.504
Okay, Hayate, that one next!

00:03:47.504 --> 00:03:48.604
Yes, my lady.

00:03:48.604 --> 00:03:50.224
Okay, say "ah".

00:03:50.404 --> 00:03:52.674
God, look at them flirting!

00:03:52.674 --> 00:03:54.334
What kind of creepy old guy are you?

00:04:00.014 --> 00:04:02.144
You on a date, Miss?

00:04:04.984 --> 00:04:06.544
Gah! Akashi!

00:04:06.824 --> 00:04:07.984
What are you doing here?

00:04:07.984 --> 00:04:10.924
Chisato! Flirting with a guy in broad daylight!

00:04:10.924 --> 00:04:13.894
Since when did I raise you
to be such an easy girl?!

00:04:14.394 --> 00:04:15.494
Easy?!

00:04:15.494 --> 00:04:17.154
You didn't raise her.

00:04:17.464 --> 00:04:20.364
Our moms dragged us along on a shopping trip!

00:04:20.364 --> 00:04:22.034
We're just waiting for them to come back!

00:04:22.034 --> 00:04:25.474
Yeah! First of all, who'd want to date Chisato?!

00:04:26.174 --> 00:04:27.374
What's the big idea?!

00:04:27.374 --> 00:04:28.404
Forget it!

00:04:28.404 --> 00:04:30.944
Oh, isn't it sweet how embarrassed they are?

00:04:30.944 --> 00:04:33.184
Darn it, Akashi, stop saying that!

00:04:33.184 --> 00:04:34.244
Yeah! Yeah!

00:04:34.244 --> 00:04:35.644
You two are so dating...

00:04:35.644 --> 00:04:37.774
Oh, they must be friends from school.

00:04:43.254 --> 00:04:45.224
We still haven't found him?

00:04:45.224 --> 00:04:47.294
Kyosuke Hyobu. Age, 80.

00:04:47.294 --> 00:04:49.224
Escapee from esper prison.

00:04:49.564 --> 00:04:51.434
Whereabouts since then, unknown.

00:04:51.434 --> 00:04:54.364
This is going to be worrisome if we can't
find and recapture him quickly.

00:04:54.364 --> 00:04:57.534
50 years ago, shortly after BABEL was created,

00:04:57.534 --> 00:05:00.374
he killed over 20 personnel.

00:05:00.374 --> 00:05:02.774
He's a criminal with terrible power.

00:05:02.774 --> 00:05:04.274
We need to capture him, fast.

00:05:04.274 --> 00:05:06.544
Yes. God knows what he's planning.

00:05:07.184 --> 00:05:10.184
If I said I wished to marry one in the future...

00:05:10.184 --> 00:05:11.274
what then?

00:05:12.054 --> 00:05:14.684
I'm worried! Very worried!

00:05:18.094 --> 00:05:19.824
Today was fun.

00:05:19.824 --> 00:05:24.494
Really! We've never had a
day off like that before.

00:05:24.494 --> 00:05:25.794
It was a limited edition...

00:05:26.134 --> 00:05:28.104
Still haven't let it go, huh?

00:05:28.104 --> 00:05:29.934
I'm more pissed at Minamoto!

00:05:29.934 --> 00:05:32.504
Him, just calling us kids and treating us like that!

00:05:32.504 --> 00:05:34.544
Like he's our guardian?

00:05:34.544 --> 00:05:36.674
I want him to treat us like grown-ups!

00:05:36.674 --> 00:05:40.204
Yeah, exactly! And give me boobs, too!

00:05:44.114 --> 00:05:47.214
Peeping now? You really are
kind of a creep, aren't you?

00:05:47.324 --> 00:05:49.254
I just thought of a fine game.

00:05:49.254 --> 00:05:50.324
Game?

00:05:50.324 --> 00:05:53.564
Those girls want to be treated like adults.

00:05:53.564 --> 00:05:55.394
So, I'll help them to be.

00:05:55.594 --> 00:05:57.734
Okay, let's go! Hurry up!

00:05:57.734 --> 00:05:58.854
Minamoto!

00:05:59.834 --> 00:06:00.834
C'mon, get off!

00:06:00.834 --> 00:06:02.434
Aw, don't be embarrassed.

00:06:02.434 --> 00:06:04.924
I'm not! For crying out loud...

00:06:06.944 --> 00:06:08.704
I said, get off of me!

00:06:08.704 --> 00:06:09.204
Aw, you love it!

00:06:09.204 --> 00:06:11.074
Oh, good morning.
Aw, you love it!

00:06:11.074 --> 00:06:12.644
Good morning.

00:06:12.644 --> 00:06:15.814
You all get along so well.
Take care, and see you later.

00:06:15.814 --> 00:06:16.644
Okay!

00:06:16.884 --> 00:06:17.954
See you later.

00:06:17.954 --> 00:06:19.644
See you later!

00:06:26.124 --> 00:06:27.294
See you, Minamoto!

00:06:27.294 --> 00:06:28.554
See you later!

00:06:28.894 --> 00:06:31.024
Study hard.

00:06:31.194 --> 00:06:32.684
Good morning!

00:06:33.064 --> 00:06:35.264
So, how was your date?

00:06:36.474 --> 00:06:38.024
Minamoto?

00:06:39.074 --> 00:06:39.974
Miss Kashiwagi.

00:06:40.504 --> 00:06:43.474
The chief... The chief is!

00:06:44.174 --> 00:06:45.874
What's wrong?!

00:06:52.284 --> 00:06:54.084
Um... Here.

00:06:54.084 --> 00:06:56.354
Thanks. You're very kind.

00:06:56.524 --> 00:06:58.994
So, what happened to the chief?

00:07:00.924 --> 00:07:03.224
To think, he'd do that... And then that!

00:07:03.564 --> 00:07:05.194
"That and that"?

00:07:05.434 --> 00:07:08.664
And then... Then he went there!

00:07:09.164 --> 00:07:11.724
No, Chief! You mustn't!

00:07:12.404 --> 00:07:14.564
Chief, how could you?!

00:07:14.904 --> 00:07:17.434
Oboro, I'm going to the chief, then I'll!

00:07:17.944 --> 00:07:20.084
Oh, just what are you imagining?

00:07:20.084 --> 00:07:22.274
M-Miss Kashiwagi?

00:07:22.614 --> 00:07:25.244
What will you do, Minamoto?

00:07:33.124 --> 00:07:34.694
I'm sorry!

00:07:34.694 --> 00:07:37.424
It was so funny, I got caught up in it.

00:07:38.264 --> 00:07:39.784
Hyobu!

00:07:43.374 --> 00:07:47.204
Such a pushover for women.
It's your most foolish point.

00:08:09.164 --> 00:08:11.064
That scar...

00:08:11.064 --> 00:08:13.504
Oh, this thing?

00:08:13.504 --> 00:08:16.904
Someone I trusted betrayed me, once.

00:08:17.604 --> 00:08:19.904
That's why I detest people like you,

00:08:19.974 --> 00:08:23.904
who act like they understand
what it's like for espers.

00:08:24.344 --> 00:08:26.904
Men like you inevitably...

00:08:27.944 --> 00:08:30.614
make their move on the espers in their care.

00:08:32.214 --> 00:08:35.984
Make their move?! Don't assume
I'm a pervert like you!

00:08:35.984 --> 00:08:37.784
Who's a pervert?!

00:08:39.424 --> 00:08:41.724
Stay where you are, Major Hyobu!

00:08:41.724 --> 00:08:44.634
I won't allow a parasite like you near those girls!

00:08:44.634 --> 00:08:49.194
Kiritsubo... You called him? Not bad.

00:08:49.974 --> 00:08:51.804
FIRE!

00:08:59.314 --> 00:09:00.784
Chief, wait!

00:09:00.984 --> 00:09:02.884
Not very discriminating, is he?

00:09:02.884 --> 00:09:05.374
Still, you're a parasite, too.

00:09:05.614 --> 00:09:07.584
Shut up, you old pedophile!

00:09:10.524 --> 00:09:13.044
You'll only maintain that guardian
facade for 5 more years.

00:09:13.594 --> 00:09:15.754
And I'm going to prove it to you.

00:09:18.494 --> 00:09:20.194
Well, I wish you luck.

00:09:20.904 --> 00:09:23.424
And never come back, you perverted freak!

00:09:27.974 --> 00:09:29.204
It's so late...

00:09:29.204 --> 00:09:32.714
First the debriefing, then the written report...

00:09:32.714 --> 00:09:34.374
So tired...

00:09:37.314 --> 00:09:38.754
That pervert...

00:09:38.814 --> 00:09:43.414
Gotta think of a way to keep him from
running next time... and catch him...

00:09:57.204 --> 00:09:59.904
Too sleepy to find your room again, Kaoru?

00:10:02.374 --> 00:10:05.174
You're in the wrong bed! Go back to your-

00:10:14.754 --> 00:10:16.124
What's wrong, Mr. Minamoto?!

00:10:16.124 --> 00:10:18.924
Aw, no fair, letting Kaoru
sleep with you by herself!

00:10:19.154 --> 00:10:21.384
Wh-What happened to you?!

00:10:26.134 --> 00:10:28.534
That bastard! He used a hypno attack on me!

00:10:30.274 --> 00:10:33.674
Minamoto? Oh. Welcome home.

00:10:33.674 --> 00:10:37.334
Please, Minamoto. I want it so bad!

00:10:37.544 --> 00:10:40.204
You want "it?" What?!

00:10:42.114 --> 00:10:43.284
Minamoto...

00:10:43.284 --> 00:10:45.014
M-Me?!

00:10:45.254 --> 00:10:48.984
Please. Just this once?

00:10:48.984 --> 00:10:50.984
I'll be a good girl.

00:10:51.054 --> 00:10:55.924
Please, buy me... my... toy.

00:10:56.634 --> 00:10:58.124
K-K-KAORU!

00:10:58.564 --> 00:11:01.364
I need to sleep! Go back to your room!

00:11:08.474 --> 00:11:09.544
I love you.

00:11:09.544 --> 00:11:10.874
And you love this, right?

00:11:14.314 --> 00:11:15.484
Wait for me in the lobby.

00:11:15.484 --> 00:11:15.884
Huh?!

00:11:16.354 --> 00:11:18.114
Okay, let's go!

00:11:18.114 --> 00:11:19.454
Okay!

00:11:19.454 --> 00:11:20.884
Minamoto!

00:11:20.884 --> 00:11:22.354
C'mon, get off!

00:11:22.354 --> 00:11:24.124
Aw, don't be embarrassed.

00:11:24.124 --> 00:11:26.214
I... I'm not embarrassed!

00:11:28.594 --> 00:11:30.754
You're heavy, that's all!

00:11:36.064 --> 00:11:38.374
Look, cut it out and get off, already.

00:11:38.374 --> 00:11:40.874
Oh, c'mon, you know you love it.

00:11:40.874 --> 00:11:42.464
Oh, good morning.

00:11:42.874 --> 00:11:44.934
Good morning.

00:11:45.144 --> 00:11:46.714
See you later.

00:11:46.714 --> 00:11:48.204
See you later!

00:11:48.884 --> 00:11:51.744
My, what's wrong with him?

00:11:53.154 --> 00:11:54.384
See you, Minamoto.

00:11:54.384 --> 00:11:55.614
See you later!

00:11:56.454 --> 00:11:58.584
Study hard.

00:11:59.154 --> 00:12:00.394
Good morning!

00:12:00.394 --> 00:12:01.724
Good morning, everyone.

00:12:03.134 --> 00:12:05.534
Dammit, Hyobu, why would you do this?

00:12:07.764 --> 00:12:10.364
Good morning, Minamoto!
Good morning, Minamoto!

00:12:10.774 --> 00:12:12.104
Morning!

00:12:12.504 --> 00:12:15.804
I wonder what he's in such a
hurry for. Sense anything?

00:12:15.804 --> 00:12:18.174
It was just for a moment, but I clearly got:

00:12:18.174 --> 00:12:22.614
"Children," " stacked," " Sakaki,"
"adult," and " examination."

00:12:22.614 --> 00:12:24.014
What's that about?

00:12:24.014 --> 00:12:24.844
Dunno.

00:12:27.824 --> 00:12:30.114
Your hair is so silky.

00:12:30.324 --> 00:12:31.994
Sakaki...

00:12:31.994 --> 00:12:34.224
Could you please be serious?

00:12:34.594 --> 00:12:36.224
Just a little joke!

00:12:36.224 --> 00:12:38.994
My hair's such a pain every
morning! Okay, let's see.

00:12:44.204 --> 00:12:47.104
I'm in love! Introduce me, Minamoto!

00:12:47.104 --> 00:12:48.834
I said be serious, right?

00:12:51.214 --> 00:12:54.544
Minamoto's been acting weird since last night.

00:12:54.544 --> 00:12:56.114
You think so too, Kaoru?

00:12:56.114 --> 00:12:57.584
Something may have happened.

00:13:02.184 --> 00:13:03.214
Hyobu?

00:13:03.424 --> 00:13:07.184
WHAT?! The major used a
hypno attack on him?!

00:13:07.494 --> 00:13:10.794
I think the hypnotic suggestion
should wear off in a few hours.

00:13:10.794 --> 00:13:12.324
There are no other problems aside from that.

00:13:12.534 --> 00:13:15.704
You see The Children as adults.
Will you be all right?

00:13:15.704 --> 00:13:17.504
No problems at all, sir.

00:13:17.504 --> 00:13:21.134
Who cares if they just look
like they've grown a bit?!

00:13:21.374 --> 00:13:23.674
Maybe you should take the day off.

00:13:23.674 --> 00:13:26.874
Why?! Because the cause of
this was my own screwup?!

00:13:27.114 --> 00:13:29.284
I am a normal, upstanding person!

00:13:29.284 --> 00:13:31.484
I have no interest at all in 10-year-old espers!

00:13:31.484 --> 00:13:33.484
Whatever's Hyobu's after, I can't give in!

00:13:33.484 --> 00:13:35.484
Let's just act like we always do!

00:13:35.484 --> 00:13:38.324
I'm a little worried by how hard
he's making his appeal here.

00:13:38.324 --> 00:13:40.884
I think Minamoto will be all right.

00:13:41.264 --> 00:13:44.494
Maybe we shouldn't tell the girls about this.

00:13:45.434 --> 00:13:46.924
He sees us as adults?!

00:13:47.334 --> 00:13:49.464
So, that's why he's been acting so weird!

00:13:49.464 --> 00:13:53.174
Hold it! It's not like we can
trust anything you say!

00:13:53.174 --> 00:13:54.474
Huh? Why not?

00:13:54.474 --> 00:13:56.074
What are you up to?

00:13:56.074 --> 00:13:57.914
Up to, she says.

00:13:57.914 --> 00:14:00.514
Minamoto treats you too much like children.

00:14:00.514 --> 00:14:03.174
Exactly! He should treat you like ladies!

00:14:03.484 --> 00:14:04.974
It... It talks!

00:14:05.184 --> 00:14:08.514
What's wrong with me talking?!
You insult rodents at your peril!

00:14:08.754 --> 00:14:10.784
It... It's so cute!

00:14:11.894 --> 00:14:14.924
I... I'm Momotaro. How do you do?

00:14:14.924 --> 00:14:17.694
This is a sunflower seed. I love them!

00:14:19.064 --> 00:14:22.034
Um... Anyway, don't you want him
to treat you like grown-ups?!

00:14:22.864 --> 00:14:24.204
Grown-ups?

00:14:24.734 --> 00:14:26.364
As a grown-up...

00:14:32.474 --> 00:14:33.874
Grown-up?

00:14:40.924 --> 00:14:42.114
LIAR

00:14:47.164 --> 00:14:48.824
Fine with us.

00:14:48.994 --> 00:14:49.724
Well?

00:14:49.724 --> 00:14:52.494
No, the girls are troubled by this.

00:14:52.494 --> 00:14:54.764
It seems I've overstepped my bounds.

00:14:55.364 --> 00:14:57.524
He'll be back to normal in a few hours.

00:14:58.274 --> 00:15:00.974
Stay away from him until then.

00:15:00.974 --> 00:15:03.344
He is a young man, after all.

00:15:03.344 --> 00:15:04.574
What do you mean?

00:15:04.574 --> 00:15:06.814
If you go after him as he is now,

00:15:06.814 --> 00:15:09.374
he may not be able to withstand your charms.

00:15:10.284 --> 00:15:12.014
He might not be able to withstand...

00:15:12.014 --> 00:15:13.744
...our charms?

00:15:14.354 --> 00:15:16.384
Hypno works by changing another person's...

00:15:16.384 --> 00:15:18.694
internal brain chemistry to create an image.

00:15:18.694 --> 00:15:21.264
In short, that's the mechanism
of hypnotic ESP power.

00:15:21.264 --> 00:15:22.764
If we can raise your blood
pressure and metabolism,

00:15:22.764 --> 00:15:25.594
I think we can clear up your hypnotic
suggestion a little faster.

00:15:26.234 --> 00:15:28.704
Still, looks like Hyobu has his good points, too.

00:15:28.704 --> 00:15:30.394
Sorry I'm late.

00:15:34.404 --> 00:15:37.374
Shiho! Wh-What are you doing in that outfit?!

00:15:37.374 --> 00:15:40.314
I've been worried about how strangely
you've been acting since last night.

00:15:40.684 --> 00:15:43.914
I just came to see if anything was wrong.

00:15:44.384 --> 00:15:46.624
I can read his mind now...

00:15:46.624 --> 00:15:49.814
and see just how he feels
about the grown-up me.

00:15:51.154 --> 00:15:53.494
I-I appreciate the concern,

00:15:53.494 --> 00:15:56.184
but Sakaki fixed me up and
I'm just fine now! Gotta go!

00:15:57.134 --> 00:15:57.824
Darn.

00:15:58.994 --> 00:16:01.204
That was close.

00:16:01.204 --> 00:16:03.764
If those girls knew I'm seeing
them as adults now...

00:16:06.234 --> 00:16:08.174
Ow! What the?

00:16:09.144 --> 00:16:13.474
Mr. Minamoto, you need to pay
attention to your surroundings.

00:16:14.714 --> 00:16:17.974
Well, Mr. Minamoto? How do
you like the grown-up me?

00:16:19.084 --> 00:16:21.214
Don't run in the halls!

00:16:22.324 --> 00:16:23.054
Darn.

00:16:27.894 --> 00:16:30.054
Found you, Minamoto.

00:16:32.894 --> 00:16:35.024
What are you wearing?

00:16:37.934 --> 00:16:40.344
I'm cold. Warm me up.

00:16:40.344 --> 00:16:42.374
Oh, quit fooling around!

00:16:42.374 --> 00:16:43.744
Aw, don't be embarrassed.

00:16:43.744 --> 00:16:46.674
About what! Now get changed
before you catch a cold!

00:16:48.714 --> 00:16:49.704
Darn.

00:16:49.844 --> 00:16:51.414
He's pretty tough, huh?

00:16:51.414 --> 00:16:53.854
In that case, we have to use that.

00:16:57.494 --> 00:17:01.294
Minamoto and The Children are
always so close, aren't they?

00:17:01.294 --> 00:17:02.724
Naomi.

00:17:02.994 --> 00:17:05.484
Naomi, I will always!

00:17:05.934 --> 00:17:06.954
Supervisor Tanizaki?

00:17:07.164 --> 00:17:09.934
...BE HERE TO WARM YOU UP! COME ON!

00:17:10.274 --> 00:17:12.564
Warm yourself up!

00:17:16.004 --> 00:17:19.344
Why are they acting like that? Unless!

00:17:19.344 --> 00:17:20.934
Mr. Minamoto.

00:17:25.414 --> 00:17:26.684
Ta-daa!

00:17:27.824 --> 00:17:29.654
How do you like them, Minamoto?

00:17:29.924 --> 00:17:31.784
How do I like what?!

00:17:32.094 --> 00:17:34.064
Oh, you know perfectly well.

00:17:34.064 --> 00:17:36.394
Now, show us how you really feel.

00:17:37.834 --> 00:17:39.124
Wait!

00:17:39.764 --> 00:17:43.664
Stay back! We can talk this over! Let's talk!

00:17:59.514 --> 00:18:02.754
There you are! The Children have been
ordered into emergency action!

00:18:04.254 --> 00:18:06.764
Why are you all dressed like that?

00:18:06.764 --> 00:18:08.264
Great! Let's go!

00:18:08.264 --> 00:18:10.094
Darn it, things were getting good, too!

00:18:13.434 --> 00:18:16.194
I wanted to be a hero!

00:18:20.244 --> 00:18:21.504
What's that about?

00:18:21.504 --> 00:18:23.574
Apparently he went to audition for a TV show,

00:18:23.574 --> 00:18:26.674
and couldn't take being cast
as faceless goon #3.

00:18:26.674 --> 00:18:27.584
Go to it.

00:18:27.584 --> 00:18:28.344
Okay.

00:18:28.484 --> 00:18:32.474
All I've wanted to be was the guy
who got that climax scene!

00:18:35.254 --> 00:18:36.884
Hold it!

00:18:38.254 --> 00:18:39.784
Who are you?!

00:18:41.064 --> 00:18:43.534
The ones with dynamite bodies and hearts!

00:18:43.534 --> 00:18:45.464
So don't treat us like kids!

00:18:45.464 --> 00:18:47.694
We attack with our adult charms!

00:18:47.864 --> 00:18:51.924
Special espers The Adults, have arrived!

00:18:53.974 --> 00:18:56.704
Why are you in bathing suits?!
And you're not even close to adults!

00:18:56.704 --> 00:18:57.874
Shut up!

00:18:57.874 --> 00:19:00.314
Wait, you girls know?!

00:19:00.514 --> 00:19:02.284
Know? Know what?

00:19:02.284 --> 00:19:04.314
We don't know anything.

00:19:04.314 --> 00:19:06.844
Hyobu didn't tell us a thing.

00:19:06.924 --> 00:19:08.184
That pervert!

00:19:08.424 --> 00:19:10.484
You're not taking me in!

00:19:13.254 --> 00:19:15.494
Special espers, The Adults...

00:19:15.494 --> 00:19:18.194
I mean, The Children, released!

00:19:18.194 --> 00:19:18.294
<<RELEASED>>
I mean, The Children, released!

00:19:18.294 --> 00:19:18.694
<<RELEASED>>

00:19:18.934 --> 00:19:21.234
PSYCHIC ADULT ATTACK!

00:19:21.834 --> 00:19:23.734
Adult, my ass!

00:19:23.734 --> 00:19:25.934
EAT THIS!

00:19:26.204 --> 00:19:27.634
Adult, my ass!

00:19:37.214 --> 00:19:39.414
I'll let this go for today.

00:19:40.014 --> 00:19:43.384
I WON'T FORGET THIS!

00:19:44.324 --> 00:19:46.094
Clichéd parting line, huh?

00:19:46.094 --> 00:19:47.694
Born to be a faceless goon.

00:19:47.694 --> 00:19:49.124
Now then...

00:19:53.364 --> 00:19:54.624
Oh, no!

00:19:56.834 --> 00:19:58.064
K-Kaoru!

00:19:58.234 --> 00:19:59.904
Now you can't run away.

00:19:59.904 --> 00:20:03.074
We're going to see how you
really feel about us.

00:20:03.074 --> 00:20:04.204
And we can't wait.

00:20:04.514 --> 00:20:07.884
Hold it! I know! Kaoru, I'll buy you that toy!

00:20:07.884 --> 00:20:08.884
Okay?! Okay?!

00:20:08.884 --> 00:20:12.484
I don't need a kid's toy! I told you,
don't treat us like kids!

00:20:12.484 --> 00:20:14.284
Treat us like grown-ups!

00:20:14.924 --> 00:20:17.854
Well, Mr. Minamoto? You like what you see?

00:20:18.924 --> 00:20:21.394
Feel like treating us like adults now?

00:20:22.064 --> 00:20:25.154
Well, what do you think? Grown
up enough for you, Minamoto?

00:20:25.334 --> 00:20:28.094
No matter what you look like,
you're still children!

00:20:29.504 --> 00:20:32.404
Boy, he's stubborn. How about now?

00:20:34.674 --> 00:20:35.874
Go on, go on!

00:20:35.874 --> 00:20:40.144
If you want this back, you need
to treat us like grown-ups.

00:20:47.324 --> 00:20:50.614
Did that work? Minamoto?

00:20:51.724 --> 00:20:52.784
SNAP!

00:20:53.664 --> 00:20:54.644
Snap?

00:20:58.934 --> 00:21:02.204
Cut it out! Acting like this just
proves you're little kids!

00:21:02.204 --> 00:21:04.104
If you want to be treated like adults,

00:21:04.104 --> 00:21:06.234
then act responsibly and don't tease people!

00:21:06.234 --> 00:21:09.574
No matter what you look like,
as long as you act like this,

00:21:09.574 --> 00:21:11.844
I'll always see you as children
and never as adults!

00:21:11.974 --> 00:21:14.814
If you want to be treated
like adults, then! Um...

00:21:18.714 --> 00:21:21.724
Um, sorry. I didn't mean to...

00:21:21.724 --> 00:21:24.884
C'mon, I'll buy you that toy. Don't cry, okay?

00:21:26.394 --> 00:21:27.664
We're sorry!

00:21:27.664 --> 00:21:29.694
We didn't mean it!

00:21:29.694 --> 00:21:31.824
Forgive us!

00:21:32.494 --> 00:21:34.484
The hypnosis wore off.

00:21:37.304 --> 00:21:39.774
You girls are fine the way you are.

00:21:40.644 --> 00:21:43.574
But why did Hyobu do this?

00:21:50.714 --> 00:21:52.514
It's sold out!

00:21:52.514 --> 00:21:55.454
I told you it was a rare limited edition!

00:21:55.454 --> 00:21:57.254
Definitely a child.
I told you it was a rare limited edition!

00:21:57.254 --> 00:21:58.844
Minamoto, you jerk!

00:21:59.154 --> 00:22:02.284
Kyosuke, was there any point to this little game?

00:22:03.164 --> 00:22:07.334
It was fun, wasn't it? But the
real fun is yet to come...

00:22:07.334 --> 00:22:09.304
my dear Minamoto.

00:22:19.474 --> 00:22:24.614
There's no point in hiding it

00:22:24.914 --> 00:22:28.974
I know everything

00:22:29.724 --> 00:22:35.164
It's no mystery, because

00:22:35.524 --> 00:22:40.934
I love you

00:22:41.164 --> 00:22:45.574
Go on, look at me

00:22:45.834 --> 00:22:50.144
Truly, the bond of love we share

00:22:50.144 --> 00:22:52.114
Is absolute!

00:22:52.344 --> 00:22:57.054
An eternal, unchanging

00:22:57.054 --> 00:23:03.694
Absolute declaration to the world
I'll shout from Everest!

00:23:03.694 --> 00:23:08.524
I've accepted it

00:23:08.524 --> 00:23:12.934
The bond of love we share

00:23:12.934 --> 00:23:15.134
Is absolute!

00:23:15.134 --> 00:23:19.574
My wish, when fortune smiles on me

00:23:19.874 --> 00:23:23.974
In San Pietro, I'll swear it to you

00:23:23.974 --> 00:23:26.774
An absolute declaration of love!

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:41.164
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:41.164 --> 00:23:42.924
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.494 --> 00:23:45.334
Your mission is to rescue victims...

00:23:45.334 --> 00:23:47.864
from a disabled fishing trawler in rough seas.

00:23:47.864 --> 00:23:50.434
We'll be taking you to the site
this time aboard BABEL 2.

00:23:50.434 --> 00:23:51.574
BABEL 2?

00:23:51.574 --> 00:23:54.404
Correct! BABEL 2 is our
latest special submarine.

00:23:54.644 --> 00:23:56.304
Special submarine?

00:23:56.304 --> 00:23:57.844
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:57.844 --> 00:24:00.914
Episode 10: "A Dangerous Kettle of
Fish! Hurry, BABEL 2!!"

00:24:00.914 --> 00:24:04.054
Now that kid thinks of the queen as a woman,

00:24:04.054 --> 00:24:04.984
but doesn't realize that will be a fatal mistake.

00:24:04.984 --> 00:24:06.354
A Dangerous Kettle of Fish!
Hurry, BABEL 2!!
but doesn't realize that will be a fatal mistake.

00:24:06.354 --> 00:24:08.684
A Dangerous Kettle of Fish!
Hurry, BABEL 2!!
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.684 --> 00:24:09.954
A Dangerous Kettle of Fish!
Hurry, BABEL 2!!
